WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.270
In the first half of 2026, international
arrivals worldwide barely grew.

2
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.850
Middle East arrivals fell 22 per cent.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:14.550
UN Tourism cut its 2026 growth
forecast to 1 to 2 per cent,

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.570
down from 3 to 4.

5
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.830
Only prices?

6
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.050
Only the weather?

7
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.270
What will shape who travels,
and who gets to play sport,

8
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.950
in the future?

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.190
In this mission, you'll look ahead,
weighing each force by its direction,

10
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.490
its scale and how certain it is.

11
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:35.270
Then you'll turn to sport, and
ask who is allowed to take part,

12
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.890
from the Olympic Games to
everyday activity in England.

13
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:41.990
Your mission: explain what
will shape who travels,

14
00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.670
and who plays sport, in the future.
